  "definition": "Service Coordination",
  "effectiveDate": "2023-12-29",
  "historyNote": "#1969, eff 2-25-82; ss by #2615, eff 2-6-84; ss by #2962, eff 1-22-85; ss by #5211, eff 8-28-91; EXPIRED: 8-28-97 New. #6581, INTERIM, eff 9-19-97, EXPIRED: 1-17-98 New. #6932, eff 1-27-99; ss by #8805, eff 1-27-07; ss by #10774, INTERIM, eff 1-27-15, EXPIRES: 7-27-15; ss by #10900, eff 7-25-15 (from He-M 503.09); ss by #13841, eff 12-29-23",
